sequenceDiagram
    actor Evaluator
    participant API as GET Adapter
    participant Planner as HyperCLOVA X
    participant Validator as Plan Validator
    participant DB as DuckDB
    participant Evidence as Evidence Builder
    participant Answer as Renderer and Claim Validator
    Evaluator->>API: question_id + question
    API->>API: byte budget, redaction, contract check
    API->>Planner: canonical question + plan schema
    Planner-->>API: typed QueryPlan
    API->>Validator: schema + registry policy
    alt invalid plan
        Validator-->>Planner: one bounded repair request
        Planner-->>Validator: repaired QueryPlan
    end
    Validator->>DB: parameterized deterministic query
    DB-->>Evidence: rows + universe + execution metadata
    Evidence-->>Answer: evidence IDs + limitations
    Answer->>Answer: every factual claim must cite evidence
    Answer-->>API: DomainAnswer
    API-->>Evaluator: provisional 5-string JSON + no-store
